---
/**
 * "How Aging Works" section — homepage.
 *
 * Structure:
 *   full-width section, bg-page
 *   ├─ Two-column header
 *   │   ├─ LEFT  eyebrow + h2 + body paragraph
 *   │   └─ RIGHT body copy (2 ¶) + primary CTA
 *   └─ Three-bucket diagram (embedded, not a separate section)
 *
 * Copy is baked in (single-page, client-specific content).
 * Do NOT fork this widget per page.
 */

import Heading from '~/components/ui/Heading.astro';
import Text from '~/components/ui/Text.astro';
import Button from '~/components/ui/Button.astro';
import BucketGraphic from '~/components/ui/BucketGraphic.astro';
import { PRIMARY_CTA_HREF } from '~/config/cta';

export interface Props {
  id?: string;
}

const { id = 'how-aging-works' } = Astro.props;
---

<section {...id ? { id } : {}} class="not-prose w-full bg-page">
  <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-container px-5 py-12 sm:px-8 md:px-16 md:py-[64px] lg:px-[120px]">
    {/* ── Two-column header ── */}
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-12 lg:flex-row lg:items-start lg:gap-[120px]">
      {/* LEFT — eyebrow + heading + intro body */}
      <div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-6">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
          <Heading variant="eyebrow">where your resources go</Heading>
          <Heading variant="h2">
            Do the basics first.<br />
            Then earn the <span class="text-accent">fancy stuff.</span>
          </Heading>
        </div>
        <Text>
          The interventions with the strongest evidence in longevity medicine are also the cheapest, and almost nobody
          does them, because there is nothing to sell. Start by finding out where you actually stand. Then fill the
          first bucket. Everything else can wait its turn.
        </Text>
      </div>

      {/* RIGHT — body copy + CTA */}
      <div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col justify-center gap-8">
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-4">
          <Text>
            They book the IV drip and the full-body scan while their blood pressure goes unmeasured and they haven't
            stood up from a chair without their hands in a decade. That isn't stupidity. It's what the entire industry
            sells.
          </Text>
          <Text>
            We are not against bucket three. Dr. Peterson files it under recreational anti-aging: if you enjoy it and
            can afford it, help yourself, same as a weekend in Las Vegas. The objection is buying it while bucket one
            sits empty.
          </Text>
        </div>
        <Button variant="primary" text="Understand the model" href="/fill-the-first-bucket" />
      </div>
    </div>{/* end two-column header */}

    {/* ── Bucket diagram ── */}
    <div class="mt-16 md:mt-[80px]">
      <Text variant="body-lg" class="mb-8 max-w-[720px]">
        The buckets: three buckets you fill in order. Each one spills into the next. Most people start with bucket
        three. Start with bucket one.
      </Text>
      <BucketGraphic cta={{ text: 'Find your weakest link', href: PRIMARY_CTA_HREF }} />

      {/* Footer note */}
      <p class="mt-8 font-sans text-body text-muted">Buckets hold your time, money and attention, not your health.</p>
    </div>{/* end bucket diagram */}
  </div>
</section>
